          "Planet Dove constellation",
          "Radiometric consistency and licensing differ from public missions."
        ],
        [
          "Sub-meter mapping",
          "WorldView or Pleiades",
          "Tasking, off-nadir angle, and cost control feasibility."
        ],
        [
          "SAR vegetation biomass",
          "NISAR L-band",
          "L-band penetration helps but can saturate."
        ],
        [
          "Hyperspectral minerals",
